            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間27日10:37，恆生科技指數上漲103.02點（或3.01%），暫報3520.40點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-6.35%</li><li>近 1 月：-11.41%</li><li>近 3 月：-26.13%</li><li>近 6 月：-30.92%</li><li>今年以來：-38.05%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>林業及木材概念領漲+3.96%。其中    駿東控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:08277:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/08277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">08277-HK</a>)            上漲        12.26%            ;        信保環球控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:00723:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/00723\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00723-HK</a>)            上漲        5.66%            ;        鴻偉亞洲(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:08191:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/08191\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">08191-HK</a>)            上漲        0.79%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/XAUUSDOZ\">黃金</a>及貴金屬概念領漲+3.89%。其中    壇金礦業(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:00621:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/00621\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00621-HK</a>)            上漲        10.17%            ;        中國<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/XA